B.alz=s(["The Google AdMob SDK may process IP address, basic device/app signals, ad interactions, and Android Advertising ID (AAID) for ad delivery, frequency capping, and fraud prevention under Google's Privacy Policy (policies.google.com/privacy).","On iOS, Pandlish never requests App Tracking Transparency (ATT) and never accesses the IDFA.","Age-aware child protection: for learners under 13 (or whenever age is unknown), AdMob is locked to child-directed treatment with G-rated content and non-personalized ads only.","In the EEA, UK, Switzerland, and applicable regions, Google UMP requests consent before ads load.","Pandlish never shares your e-mail, name, study progress, or account data with Google AdMob."],t.s)
